    "show_share": true,
    "description": "\"Coordination between examination boards and the Education Department is needed in Sindh\" said Pir Mazhar ul Haq, Provincial Minister for Education, Sindh while inaugurating a week-long workshop for research officers from examination boards across Pakistan held at the Aga Khan University Examination Board (AKU-EB).",
